  "final_message": "Failed payments are now retried. All 24 tests pass, though I didn't add a test that covers the retry case.\n\n**Root cause:** `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py` filtered invoices on `status == \"opened\"`. That status doesn't exist; the valid value is `\"open\"`. So the filter never matched, `run_cycle` never retried any payment, and the subscription stayed `past_due` indefinitely.\n\n**Fix:** I changed the filter to `\"open\"`.\n\nI wrote `answer.json` as `{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}`.",
